=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
$
# User Configuration -------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Sudo                 Enabled, No password$
  [*] SSH Keys             None$
$
   -  Create user george$
      $ useradd --create-home --shell /bin/bash george$
$
   -  Add george to the sudo group$
      $ usermod -aG sudo george$
$
   -  Let george use sudo without a password$
      /etc/sudoers.d/hardn-george$
      @@ -0,0 +1 @@$
      +george ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL$
      $ visudo -cf /etc/sudoers.d/hardn-george$
$
  [i] Info: No actual changes were made to your system.$

